# FE Coding Rule

Always follow `docs/PROJECT-RULES.md` and `docs/UI_GUIDELINES.md`.

## State boundaries

- TanStack Query for all backend data.
- Zustand only for auth/session/UI flags.
- Never duplicate server state into Zustand.

## UI boundaries

- Tailwind CSS + shadcn/ui only.
- Wrap shared primitives when feature behavior or project styling must be standardized.
- Every major screen must handle loading, empty, error, and success states.

## Form and feature rules

- Keep feature-specific components, hooks, and forms inside the owning feature.
- Do not place feature business logic into shared UI primitives.
- Prefer predictable operational UI over decorative complexity.
